WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
[MUSIC PLAYING]
[音乐播放中]

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.840
BRIAN YU: Welcome back, everyone, to now our final class in this Introduction
布莱恩·余：欢迎大家回来，现在是我们《用Scratch学编程》入门课程的最后一节课。

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.160
to Programming with Scratch.
用Scratch学编程。

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.040
And at this point, we've seen most of the major features
到目前为止，我们已经了解了Scratch的大部分主要功能。

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.280
that Scratch has to offer.
Scratch所提供的内容。

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.670
So today in this final class, what we thought we'd do
所以在今天这节最后一课中，我们打算

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:31.580
is show you a few additional features that you might find useful
向你们展示一些额外的功能，你们可能会觉得这些功能在

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.380
as you go about building your own projects
你们自己开发项目时会很有用。

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.620
and then show you how you could put the pieces together, so to speak,
然后，这么说吧，向你们展示如何将这些功能整合起来。

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.430
and use all of the tools and the ideas that we've explored during this course
利用我们在这门课程中探索过的所有工具和理念。

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:44.510
to see how you could put them together to create a complete game using
看看如何将它们组合起来，用Scratch创建一个完整的游戏。

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:45.440
Scratch.
Scratch。

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.620
So let's go ahead and begin by taking a look at a couple final features
那我们现在就开始，来看看Scratch的几个最后要介绍的功能。

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.030
of Scratch to introduce.
介绍Scratch的相关内容。

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:54.540
And the first involves how it is that sprites communicate with each other.
第一个功能涉及角色之间如何相互通信。

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.420
You might recall that in an earlier project,
你们可能还记得，在之前的一个项目中，

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.267
we had a cat talking to a dinosaur, for example.
比如，我们让一只猫和一只恐龙对话。

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.100
And how we did that was something like this.
我们是这样实现的。

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:05.239
I had a cat, and then I added the dinosaur, which
我有一只猫，然后我添加了一只恐龙，我

00:01:05.239 --> 00:01:07.430
I'll go ahead and find and bring back.
这就去找出来并把它弄回来。

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.020
I wanted the cat and the dinosaur to be facing each other.
我想让猫和恐龙面对面。

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.620
So I took the dinosaur and I set its rotation
所以我选中恐龙，设置它的旋转方式。

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:16.440
to left right and then set its direction to negative 90
为左右旋转，然后将它的方向设置为 -90。

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.240
so it was facing the other way.
这样它就朝另一个方向了。

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.320
And if I wanted the cat and the dinosaur to greet each other,
如果我想让猫和恐龙互相打招呼，

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:29.390
then I would have the cat when the flag is clicked do something like say hello
那么我会让猫在点击绿旗时，做类似说“你好”

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.330
to the dinosaur.
给恐龙这样的事。

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:35.810
And then likewise for the dinosaur, if I want the dinosaur to respond
同样地，对于恐龙，如果我想让恐龙回应

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:38.000
to the cat saying hello, well, the cat is
猫说的“你好”，嗯，猫会

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.430
saying hello dinosaur for two seconds.
对恐龙说“你好”两秒钟。

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:44.120
So the dinosaur better wait two seconds before it responds.
所以恐龙最好在回应之前等两秒钟。

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.700
So the dinosaur, I did something like this.
所以对于恐龙，我是这么做的。

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.850
I said when the flag is clicked, let's go under Control.
我说当点击绿旗时，我们到“控制”类别里看看。

00:01:49.850 --> 00:02:00.050
Let's wait two seconds and then say hello to the cat.
等两秒钟，然后对猫说“你好”。

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.560
So now when I run the project, the cat says hello dinosaur.
所以现在当我运行这个项目时，猫会说“你好，恐龙”。

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.580
And immediately after, the dinosaur says hello cat.
紧接着，恐龙会说“你好，猫”。

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.270
What if I later wanted to make a change?
如果我之后想做些改变呢？

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.530
I want the cat to only say hello dinosaur for maybe one second,
比如，我想让猫只对恐龙说一秒钟“你好”。

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:13.490
for example.
例如。

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:17.450
Well, now the cat speaks and I have this weird pause
嗯，现在猫说完了，会有一段奇怪的停顿。

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:20.690
before the dinosaur responds, because I forgot to change
在恐龙做出回应之前，因为我忘了更改

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:22.610
how long the dinosaur was waiting.
恐龙等待的时长。

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:25.010
I'd also have to change that from two to one
我还得把等待时长从两秒改成一秒

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.650
in order to get it to respond appropriately.
才能让它做出合适的回应。

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.875
Ultimately, this is going to start to get more complex, especially as there
最终，这会变得越来越复杂，尤其是当

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:33.560
are more interactions between these two sprites
这两个角色之间有更多互动时

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.810
or if later I add other sprites altogether
或者如果之后我再添加其他角色

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:38.960
for me to have to calculate exactly how long every sprite should
我就得精确计算每个角色在

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.560
be waiting in between one thing happening and another thing happening.
一件事发生到另一件事发生之间应该等待多久。

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:46.460
What would be better is if the cat when it was done speaking
更好的办法是，当猫说完话后

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:50.870
could somehow signal to the dinosaur that it's now the dinosaurs turn
能以某种方式向恐龙发出信号，告诉它现在轮到它

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.800
to start speaking.
开始说话了。

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.930
That way I, the programmer, don't have to do
这样一来，作为程序员的我就不用

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.210
all this math of figuring out exactly how
做这些精确计算

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.430
long these sprites should be waiting.
这些角色应该等待多久的数学运算了。

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.530
And so this brings us to one of our final topics
这就引出了我们在Scratch里的最后一个主题

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.080
in Scratch, which is called broadcasting.
叫做广播。

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:07.370
Broadcasting is the ability for one object in Scratch, one sprite,
广播是指Scratch里的一个对象，比如一个角色

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:12.650
for example, to send some message that other sprites like the dinosaur,
能够发送某种消息，其他角色，比如这里的恐龙

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.660
in this case, could receive.
可以接收这些消息。

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:17.900
So we have the ability to send or broadcast messages.
所以我们有发送或广播消息的能力。

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.290
And then we have the ability for other sprites to receive those messages.
然后其他角色有接收这些消息的能力。

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:25.672
When they receive a message, the sprites are going to respond in some way.
当它们接收到消息时，角色会以某种方式做出回应。

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.880
So what would that look like?
那会是什么样的呢？

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:30.590
How could we broadcast a message from the cat to the dinosaur
我们怎样才能从猫向恐龙广播一条消息

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:34.370
so that the dinosaur knows that it's time to greet the cat?
让恐龙知道是时候向猫打招呼了呢？

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.140
Let's go back to the cat.
让我们回到猫这个角色。

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:41.060
And after the cat says hello dinosaur for let's go back to two seconds,
猫说“你好，恐龙”持续两秒后，

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:48.710
then under Event, I'm going to use this broadcast block to broadcast a message.
在“事件”分类下，我要用这个广播积木来广播一条消息。

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:51.080
And I'm going to choose a new message from the dropdown.
我要从下拉菜单里选择一条新消息。

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.850
And I can just name this message.
我可以给这条消息命名。

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.400
This is any message that I'm now going to send.
这就是我现在要发送的任意一条消息。

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.730
And I'm going to call the message greet, just because it's
我把这条消息命名为“打招呼”，只是因为它

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.460
going to be a message that signals to the dinosaur
是一条向恐龙发出信号的消息

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.980
that it's time to greet the cat.
告诉它是时候向猫打招呼了。

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.030
So the cat says hello dinosaur and then broadcasts greet.
所以猫说“你好，恐龙”，然后广播“打招呼”。

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:13.280
And the dinosaur now instead of saying hello cat when the flag is clicked,
现在恐龙不用在点击绿旗时说“你好，猫”了，

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.700
I'm going to get rid of the when flag is clicked event entirely
我要把点击绿旗这个事件完全去掉

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:22.670
and replace it with this event here when I receive greet.
用“当接收到打招呼”这个事件来替换它。

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:26.630
So the cat is first going to say hello dinosaur for two seconds
所以猫会先对恐龙说两秒“你好，恐龙”

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.680
and then broadcast this message.
然后广播这条消息。

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.650
The message is greet.
消息内容是“greet”。

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:34.700
And then the dinosaur when it receives the greet message is then
然后当恐龙收到“greet”消息时，它就会

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.890
going to say hello to the cat.
对猫说“你好”。

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:41.360
And so now the cat says hello dinosaur, and immediately the dinosaur
所以现在猫说“你好，恐龙”，紧接着恐龙

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.710
responds hello cat.
回应“你好，猫”。

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:46.250
The cat broadcasted a message and the dinosaur received it.
猫广播了一条消息，恐龙收到了它。

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.170
And now it doesn't matter if there's a delay.
现在就算有延迟也没关系了。

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:52.250
I could add a delay of a second to the cat.
我可以给猫加一秒的延迟。

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.700
And so the cat will now wait a second before speaking,
这样猫现在说话前会先等一秒，

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.830
but the dinosaur still responds right on cue.
但恐龙仍然能适时做出回应。

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.060
I didn't have to change any of the timing,
我不用改变任何时间设置，

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.290
because the cat broadcasted a message once the cat was
因为猫做完它正在做的任何事之后就广播了一条消息，然后恐龙就能做出回应。

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:08.130
done doing whatever it was doing and the dinosaur was then able to respond.
完成了它正在做的任何事情，然后恐龙就能做出回应了。

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.783
So this works great for stories where you have multiple sprites
所以对于有多个角色的故事来说，这非常有用，

00:05:10.783 --> 00:05:13.700
and they're interacting in some way and you want some sprite to signal
它们以某种方式进行互动，你想让某个角色在轮到它说话或做事时

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.750
to someone else when it's their turn to say something or do something,
向其他角色发出信号，

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.590
for example.
举个例子。

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:22.070
It can also be used in other ways to let one sprite control
它还可以用其他方式让一个角色控制

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.130
or influence the behavior of another sprite.
或影响另一个角色的行为。

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.830
Let's imagine that I had a duck.
我们来想象一下我有一只鸭子。

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:34.280
Let's add a new animal and let's go back to the duck here.
我们添加一个新动物，回到这里选鸭子。

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.787
And let's say I wanted the duck to move up and down.
假设我想让鸭子上下移动。

00:05:36.787 --> 00:05:38.120
And we could use the arrow keys.
我们可以用方向键。

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.280
I could use the up and down arrow keys to control it.
我可以用上下方向键来控制它。

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.363
But I'd like for the user just to be able to click
但我希望用户只需点击

00:05:42.363 --> 00:05:45.620
on up and down arrows on the screen as some user interface
屏幕上的上下箭头，作为某种用户界面

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.020
that they could use as a visual on the screen that
他们可以在屏幕上直观地操作，

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:51.620
lets them control if the duck is going to move up or move down.
从而控制鸭子是向上还是向下移动。

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.270
So let's add that interface.
所以我们来添加那个界面。

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:55.070
Here's an arrow.
这里有一个箭头。

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.910
And right now the arrow is facing the right.
现在这个箭头朝右。

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:00.410
But if I wanted to go up, then I'm going to rotate it instead of 90 degrees,
但如果我想让它朝上，那我不旋转90度了，

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.150
let's set it to 0 degrees.
我们把它设置为0度。

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.970
That's going to be an arrow that's facing up.
这样箭头就朝上了。

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:10.400
And if I want a button that lets the duck go down, let's add an arrow.
如果我想要一个能让鸭子向下移动的按钮，我们再添加一个箭头。

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.530
And this time set it to 180 degrees.
这次把它设置为180度。

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:16.890
And now the arrow is facing down.
现在箭头朝下了。

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.680
So now I have two arrows.
所以现在我有两个箭头了。

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:22.140
But clicking these arrows doesn't achieve anything.
但点击这些箭头没有任何效果。

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:25.790
They just do nothing right now because I haven't added any code to them.
它们现在什么都不做，因为我还没给它们添加任何代码。

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.200
But I could.
但我可以添加。

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:32.960
Let me add an event to the up arrow that says when this sprite is clicked,
我给向上箭头添加一个事件，当点击这个角色时，

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:38.480
when I click on the up arrow, well then let's broadcast a message.
当我点击向上箭头时，那就广播一条消息。

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.210
And the message is going to be up.
这条消息是“向上”。

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.670
That's the direction you should move.
这就是你应该移动的方向。

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.320
Now let's choose the down arrow.
现在让我们选择向下箭头。

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.280
This time when the sprite is clicked, let's
这次当点击这个角色时，让我们

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:53.180
broadcast a message not up, but this time a new message.
广播一条消息，不是“向上”，而是一条新消息。

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.530
And the message is going to be down.
这条消息是“向下”。

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:58.700
So now the up arrow is broadcasting a message that says up.
所以现在向上箭头在广播一条“向上”的消息。

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:02.030
The down arrow is broadcasting a message that says down.
向下箭头在广播一条“向下”的消息。

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:05.120
And now I'll have the duck respond to those broadcasts.
现在我要让鸭子对这些广播做出响应。

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:10.010
When the duck receives the up message, well then
当鸭子收到“向上”的消息时，那么

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:16.220
let's have the duck change its y value by 10 going upward in direction.
让鸭子的y值增加10，也就是向上移动。

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:22.340
And likewise under Events, when the duck receives the down broadcast message,
同样在“事件”里，当鸭子收到“向下”的广播消息时，

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:28.010
then we're going to change the y value by negative 10.
那么我们要把y值减少10。

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.430
And now these arrows, these sprites on the screen,
现在这些箭头，屏幕上的这些角色，

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.230
are controlling the behavior of the duck.
正在控制鸭子的行为。

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.470
If I click the up arrow, the duck moves up.
如果我点击向上箭头，鸭子就向上移动。

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:39.470
And if I click the down arrow, the duck moves down.
如果我点击向下箭头，鸭子就向下移动。

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.540
And they're doing that because of broadcasting.
它们能这样做是因为广播机制。

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.720
When I click on the arrows, those arrows are themselves
当我点击这些箭头时，这些箭头本身

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:48.020
sprites that are saying move up or move down.
就是在说“向上移动”或“向下移动”的角色。

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.970
They're broadcasting some message.
它们在广播一些消息。

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:55.190
And the duck in turn is then responding to those messages.
而鸭子则会对这些消息做出响应。

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:59.930
And it doesn't just have to be sprites that are broadcasting messages.
不只是角色可以广播消息。

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:03.350
The stage, the background can broadcast messages too.
舞台，也就是背景也能广播消息。

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.090
I'll show you an example of that.
我给你们举个例子。

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.860
I'll delete all of these sprites for now.
我现在先把这些角色都删掉。

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.270
Let's add a backdrop.
我们添加一个背景。

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.270
And let's go back to our underwater backdrop.
让我们回到水下背景。

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.850
And let's bring our fish back.
再把我们的鱼加回来。

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:20.270
So I'll add a new sprite and add back the fish.
所以我要添加一个新角色，把鱼加回去。

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.540
And now what I would like to do is in the backdrop,
现在我想在背景里做些操作，

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.150
I'll click on the backdrop, add some code here,
我点击背景，在这里添加一些代码，

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:31.160
I'll say whenever the stage is clicked, when stage clicked,
我说每当点击舞台时，当舞台被点击，

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.669
let's now broadcast a message.
现在让我们广播一条消息。

00:08:34.669 --> 00:08:38.150
And the message is going to be visit.
这条消息是“前往”。

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:44.870
I would like the fish to visit wherever I click on the stage.
我希望鱼能游到我点击舞台的任何地方。

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:49.000
And now for the fish whenever it receives the visit message,
现在对于这条鱼，每当它收到“访问”消息时，

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.530
let's have the fish point towards the mouse pointer
让这条鱼指向鼠标指针

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:59.060
and then take one second to glide to the mouse pointer.
然后花一秒钟滑向鼠标指针。

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.160
So now I press the flag.
所以现在我点击旗帜。

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.550
At first, nothing happens.
一开始，什么都没发生。

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:06.400
But if I choose a location and then click, the fish goes there.
但如果我选一个位置然后点击，鱼就会游过去。

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:11.380
I choose the location and click, and the fish visits wherever I happen to click.
我选好位置并点击，鱼就会游到我点击的地方。

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:12.130
I click over here.
我在这里点击。

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.310
The fish goes there.
鱼游过去了。

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:17.170
And every time when I click, the backdrop is broadcasting a message.
每次我点击时，背景都会广播一条消息。

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.990
The stage is broadcasting this visit message
舞台正在广播这条“访问”消息

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.380
and the fish is now receiving that visit message
而这条鱼现在正在接收那条“访问”消息

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:26.320
and doing something in response, pointing towards the mouse pointer
并做出相应的动作，指向鼠标指针

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.560
and gliding there.
然后滑向那里。

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:31.390
So broadcasting allows multiple different parts of our Scratch project
所以广播能让我们Scratch项目的多个不同部分

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:36.370
to communicate with each other to decide when something should happen.
相互通信，以决定何时该发生某些事情。

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:40.330
And that's one very powerful, very useful feature within Scratch.
这是Scratch里一个非常强大、非常有用的功能。

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:44.470
Another feature that can be useful, and for this I'll get rid of the backdrop,
另一个可能有用的功能，为此我要去掉这个背景，

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.320
I'll go back to the default white backdrop,
我要回到默认的白色背景，

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.650
is the ability to clone a sprite.
就是克隆角色的能力。

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.350
If I have one copy of a sprite oftentimes in a game
如果在游戏里我有一个角色的副本

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.320
or in some sort of other animation, I might not just one
或者在某种其他动画里，我可能不只要

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.130
copy of a sprite on the stage, but I might want multiple copies
舞台上有一个角色副本，而是可能想要多个副本

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:03.020
of that sprite on the stage as well.
也出现在舞台上。

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.270
So let's add a sprite.
所以让我们添加一个角色。

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:08.320
Let me search for the star and let's grab the star.
我来搜索星星，然后选中星星这个角色。

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.450
And maybe what I'd like to happen is to not just
也许我希望的情况不只是

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:15.890
have one star but to have multiple stars inside of my project.
有一颗星星，而是在我的项目中有多颗星星。

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.670
So let's add some code here.
所以让我们在这里添加一些代码。

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:23.740
I'll say when this sprite is clicked, when I click on the star,
我要说当点击这个角色时，也就是当我点击星星时，

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:30.550
I am going to, and this is under Control, create a clone of myself.
我要，这个在“控制”分类里，创建一个自身的克隆体。

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:34.000
When the star is clicked, we're going to create a clone of the star.
当点击星星时，我们要创建一个星星的克隆体。

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.550
And that new clone is going to be another star that
那个新的克隆体将是另一颗星星，它

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:39.170
can behave on its own.
可以自行行动。

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.360
Now I'll add this new event.
现在我要添加这个新事件。

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:44.230
When I start as a clone, what should this clone star do?
当我作为一个克隆体启动时，这个克隆的星星应该做什么呢？

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:50.270
Well, let's have the cloned star just glide one second to a random position.
嗯，让这个克隆的星星花一秒钟滑到一个随机位置吧。

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.730
So I have this star, and watch what happens.
所以我有了这颗星星，看看会发生什么。

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:58.490
Every time I click on the star, the star creates a new clone.
每次我点击星星，星星就会创建一个新的克隆体。

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.600
Every time I click, a new clone is created.
每次我点击，就会创建一个新的克隆体。

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.350
And when the new star starts as a clone, it's
当新的星星以克隆体形式出现时，它会

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.720
going to glide to a random position.
滑行到一个随机位置。

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:10.880
Every time I clone a star, you'll see we create a duplicate event
每次我克隆一颗星星，你会看到我们创建了一个重复事件

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.950
and it ends up going to a random position.
最终它会移动到一个随机位置。

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:17.930
So if I want multiple of a particular sprite that appear on the stage,
所以如果我想让特定角色的多个副本出现在舞台上，

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:19.350
cloning is a great way to do that.
克隆是个很好的办法。

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.920
We can create multiple copies of a sprite
我们可以创建角色的多个副本

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:27.470
and then decide how it is that those clones should ultimately behave.
然后决定这些克隆体最终应该如何表现。

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:30.140
So now I'll go ahead and get rid of all those clones
所以现在我要把所有那些克隆体都清除掉

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:34.870
just by deleting the sprite and clearing the screen.
只要删除角色并清空屏幕就行。

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:37.870
Now we've seen a lot of features that Scratch has to offer.
现在我们已经看到了Scratch提供的很多功能。

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:40.030
We've seen functions and we've seen events.
我们看到了函数，也看到了事件。

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:43.420
We've seen variable, loops and conditions, and now the ability
我们看到了变量、循环和条件，现在还有能力

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.940
to broadcast messages and clone sprites.
广播消息和克隆角色。

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.430
Let's take all of those ideas now and put them
现在让我们把所有这些想法整合起来

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.100
together inside of a fully complete game to show you
放进一个完整的游戏里，给你们展示

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:55.810
how you could go about building a more complex project within Scratch.
如何在Scratch中构建一个更复杂的项目。

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.010
And what characters should I use in the game?
我在游戏里应该用哪些角色呢？

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:02.380
Let's start and just start building this game one piece at a time.
让我们开始，一次一点地来构建这个游戏。

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:05.800
Well, let's start by using the cat.
好吧，让我们先从使用猫咪角色开始。

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.780
Sort of the classic default sprite character.
它算是经典的默认角色。

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:12.140
And let's have the cat have some objective.
让猫咪有个目标。

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.765
What is the cat trying to do?
猫咪要做什么呢？

00:12:13.765 --> 00:12:15.640
Well, I can just scroll through these sprites
嗯，我可以滚动浏览这些角色

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.140
and look for what seems interesting.
看看有什么看起来有趣的。

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.880
Here are the crystals.
这里有水晶。

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:23.177
Let's have the cat try to catch as many crystals as it can.
让猫咪尽可能多地去抓水晶。

