Well, just thinking about what I want the game to do,
嗯，想想我希望游戏怎么运行，

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.600
I could decide how I would like the game to work.
我就能决定游戏该怎么设计了。

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.480
And maybe the crystals are going to fall from the sky
也许水晶会从天上掉下来

