So let's add an event.
那我们来添加一个事件。

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:06.920
When the left arrow is clicked, we're going to change x by negative 10.
当按下左箭头键时，我们要将x坐标减去10。

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.300
And I'll duplicate this as well.
我也把这个积木复制一份。

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:14.370
And I'll say that when the right arrow is clicked, let's change x by 10.
我要说，当按下右箭头键时，把x坐标加上10。

