It can move around to the left and it can move around to the right.
它可以向左移动，也可以向右移动。

00:13:20.362 --> 00:13:21.320
And that's what I want.
这就是我想要的效果。

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.163
As the crystals are falling, the cat's going
