to go back to the middle of the stage just as a starting point.
回到舞台中央作为起始点。

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:50.480
So I'll have the cat first go to 0 for x.
所以我先让猫的x坐标设为0。

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:53.120
And we'll go negative 125 for y.
然后y坐标设为 -125。

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:58.820
So this now is the starting point for the cat at 0 for x, negative 125 for y.
现在这就是猫的起始点，x坐标为0，y坐标为 -125。

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:04.310
And from there, I can use the arrow keys to move back and forth.
从这里开始，我就可以用箭头键来回移动了。

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.740
And because it's a game, it's probably helpful for me
因为这是一个游戏，对我来说

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.360
to tell the user how to play the game.
告诉玩家怎么玩这个游戏可能会有帮助。

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:13.850
So let's add a message for the cat to say.
那我们给猫添加一条要说的消息。

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:18.680
And the cat's going to say something like, catch the crystals
猫会说类似“接住水晶”这样的话

