然后做出反应。

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.190
So we're going to start.
那么我们要开始了。

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:37.850
The cat speaks.
猫说话了。

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.250
Catch the crystals without letting them hit the ground.
接住水晶，别让它们掉到地上。

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.260
And now we have the ability to move around.
现在我们可以四处移动了。

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.210
