when this program starts running, let's go under Looks and let's hide.
当这个程序开始运行，我们到外观模块里，把它隐藏起来。

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:19.580
So initially when I start the program, all that we see is the cat.
所以最初我启动程序时，我们只能看到猫角色。

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.630
The cat gives the instructions.
猫角色给出游戏说明。

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.110
And now that the instructions are over, I
现在说明已经结束了，我

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:27.650
would like the cat to somehow signal to the crystal, all right, it's OK for you
希望猫角色能以某种方式给水晶角色发出信号，好了，你可以

