to create a crystal to now start falling from the sky.
创建一个水晶，让它从天空开始下落。

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.250
And maybe eventually in my game, I'm going
也许最终在我的游戏里，我打算

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:37.950
to have multiple crystals moving around, but we'll start with just one.
让多个水晶四处移动，但我们先从一个开始。

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.450
And what is this going to look like?
这会是什么样子呢？

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.910
How does the cat signal to the crystal that we're done giving instructions?
猫角色如何向水晶角色发出信号，表明说明已经说完了呢？

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.790
It's time for the crystal to now appear.
现在是水晶角色出现的时候了。

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.140
Well, we can use broadcasting.
嗯，我们可以使用广播。

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:51.170
Remember that broadcasting allows one sprite to send
记得广播能让一个角色向另一个角色发送

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.710
a message to another sprite to indicate that it's now their turn
一条消息，表明现在轮到对方

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:59.420
to do something or say something or appear on the stage.
做某事、说某事或者出现在舞台上。

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:03.170
So I'll go to Events and we'll broadcast a message.
所以我要去事件模块，然后广播一条消息。

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:09.900
And the message will be a new message just called begin.
这条消息将是一条新消息，就叫“开始”。

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.150
Begin is going to mean, all right, now is the time to actually begin the game.
“开始”的意思是，好了，现在是真正开始游戏的时候了。

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.050
We're done giving the instructions.
我们已经说完说明。

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:20.420
And now the crystal needs to respond to that begin message.
现在水晶角色需要对这条“开始”消息做出回应。

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:24.588
So when I receive begin, now the crystal can decide what to do.
所以当我接收到“开始”消息时，现在水晶角色可以决定要做什么。

00:16:24.588 --> 00:16:26.380
But as I'm thinking ahead to the way that I
但当我提前考虑这个游戏里代码

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.540
want to organize the code in this game, I'm
的组织方式时，我

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:31.480
realizing that I might not just want one crystal.
意识到我可能不只想有一个水晶。

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.700
I might not just have one crystal that's falling,
可能不会只有一个水晶在下落，

