but I probably want to have multiple crystals falling.
但我可能希望有多个水晶在下落。

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.040
Once one crystal falls, I want another crystal to appear,
一个水晶落下去后，我希望另一个水晶出现，

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:42.890
and maybe there are eventually going to be multiple crystals at the same time.
也许最终会同时有多个水晶。

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.090
And so thinking ahead, when I receive begin,
所以提前考虑一下，当我接收到“开始”消息时，

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:50.890
let's go ahead and create a clone of the crystal.
我们来创建一个水晶的克隆体。

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.600
Just create a brand new crystal.
就创建一个全新的水晶。

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:55.120
And every time I create a clone of a crystal,
每次我创建一个水晶的克隆体时，

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:59.960
I'll get a new crystal that's going to start falling from the sky.
我就会得到一个新的水晶，它会从天空开始下落。

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.330
And so what should happen?
那么接下来会发生什么呢？

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:09.260
When the crystal starts as a clone, let's start now by showing the crystal.
当水晶以克隆体的形式开始时，我们先让水晶显示出来。

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.329
So how is this working?
那么这是如何运作的呢？

00:17:10.329 --> 00:17:12.640
At first the crystal is going to hide itself.
一开始，水晶会把自己隐藏起来。

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.010
But once we receive the begin message from the cat,
但一旦我们从猫那里收到“开始”的消息，

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.579
once the cat is done giving the instructions and the cat says begin,
一旦猫说完了指令并说“开始”，

00:17:18.579 --> 00:17:21.579
we're going to create a new clone of the crystal.
我们就要创建一个新的水晶克隆体。

00:17:21.579 --> 00:17:25.670
And when the crystal starts as a clone, the crystal will show itself.
当水晶以克隆体的形式启动时，水晶会显示出来。

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:28.780
So we see the instructions from the cat.
所以我们看到了猫给出的指令。

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:33.410
And then after the instructions are over, we now see the crystal up here.
然后指令结束后，我们现在能看到这里出现了水晶。

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.900
We'd like for that crystal to go somewhere.
我们希望那个水晶能移动到某个地方。

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.708
So let's have the crystal go to--
所以让水晶移动到——

00:17:38.708 --> 00:17:40.000
we'll have it centered for now.
目前我们让它居中。

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.590
We'll have it centered at 0.
我们让它在x坐标为0的位置居中。

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:43.240
And y should be pretty big.
并且y坐标应该比较大。

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.760
I'll make it 160 just to make it a little taller.
我把它设为160，让它高一点。

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:48.520
And so now the cat gives the instructions.
现在猫给出指令。

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.370
And after the instructions are over, the crystal
指令结束后，水晶

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:54.730
appears right at the top up high at the top of the screen.
出现在屏幕顶部很高的位置。

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.130
But now I'd like the crystal to start falling.
但现在我希望水晶开始下落。

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.460
It's up in the sky.
它在天空中。

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.760
Now I need to get it to move down.
现在我要让它向下移动。

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:04.600
Well, I can move down just by changing the y value.
嗯，我可以通过改变y值来让它向下移动。

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.140
If I change the y value by a negative number, like negative 1,
如果我把y值减去一个数，比如减1，

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:10.990
or if I wanted a little faster, negative 2 for example,
或者如果我想让它快一点，比如减2，

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:14.050
that's going to cause the crystal to move down.
这会让水晶向下移动。

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:18.167
But now I don't just want the crystal to move down once,
但现在我不只想让水晶移动一次，

00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:20.500
but I want the crystal to move down over and over again,
我想让水晶反复地向下移动，

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:24.730
to move down a little bit and then keep moving down again and again and again.
向下移动一点，然后一直不停地向下移动。

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:31.790
So I'll put all of that under control inside of a forever loop.
所以我要把这些操作都放在一个无限循环里。

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.370
So now here's what's happening.
现在来看看会发生什么。

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:36.790
When we start a new crystal, the crystal is going to show itself.
当我们创建一个新的水晶时，水晶会显示出来。

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:39.040
It's going to go up to the top of the screen,
它会移动到屏幕顶部，

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:42.430
and then forever it's just going to start falling.
然后就会一直下落。

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.500
So now we can see what happens.
现在我们可以看看会发生什么了。

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.450
The cat gives the instructions.
猫给出指令。

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:52.050
The crystal appears, and the crystal now is falling.
水晶出现了，现在正在下落。

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:54.230
And so this is often what the development process
这通常就是游戏的开发过程。

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.130
is like for the game.
游戏开发就是这样。

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.260
It's not that you're going to write all of the blocks
并不是说你要把所有的积木代码都写好，

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.870
and put together all the different sprites for the entire game
把游戏里所有不同的角色都组合起来，

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.903
and then run it and see the finished product.
然后运行程序，看到成品。

00:19:01.903 --> 00:19:04.320
It's that you're going to build it a little bit at a time.
而是要一点一点地构建它。

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.300
I need the cat to move.
我需要让猫移动。

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:07.400
I need the cat to speak some instructions.
我需要让猫说出一些指令。

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.823
I need the crystal to appear.
我需要让水晶出现。

00:19:08.823 --> 00:19:10.490
Now I need the crystal to start falling.
现在我需要让水晶开始下落。

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.980
And after each time, you add just a few blocks
每次之后，你只需添加几个积木

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.660
to change the behavior a little bit.
来稍微改变一下它的行为。

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:16.638
You can run the project, see what happens,
你可以运行项目，看看会发生什么，

00:19:16.638 --> 00:19:18.680
and if you need to tinker with some of the blocks
如果你需要调整一些积木

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:21.650
to make it work if it didn't work the way you wanted it to work.
让它按照你想要的方式运行，要是它没按你期望的那样工作的话。

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:25.620
And we're now just building this game slowly one piece at a time.
现在我们只是一次一点地慢慢构建这个游戏。

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:26.780
So what do we have so far?
那么目前我们有什么呢？

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.310
We have a cat that can move around.
我们有一只可以四处移动的猫。

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.250
That works.
这没问题。

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.810
We have a crystal that appears from the sky and starts to fall.
我们有一颗从天空出现并开始下落的水晶。

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:36.950
But right now nothing yet happens once the cat catches the crystal.
但目前，当猫抓到水晶时，还没有任何事情发生。

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:39.620
Once the crystal touches the cat.
当水晶碰到猫时。

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.860
So let's add that.
所以让我们加上这部分。

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.540
How can we do that?
我们该怎么做呢？

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.630
Well, that sounds like a condition.
嗯，这听起来像是个条件。

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:48.770
We're checking if the crystal is touching the cat.
我们要检查水晶是否碰到了猫。

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.700
So let's add an if statement into the loop.
所以让我们在循环里添加一个“如果”语句。

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:58.790
And we'll say if we're touching not the mouse pointer but the cat.
我们要说如果碰到的不是鼠标指针，而是猫。

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:03.060
If the crystal is touching the cat, well then what should happen?
如果水晶碰到了猫，那么接下来该发生什么呢？

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.760
Well, I want to somehow keep score.
嗯，我想以某种方式计分。

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:08.810
I want to keep track of how many crystals has the cat caught.
我想记录猫抓到了多少颗水晶。

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.060
And so to do that I need to store information
所以要做到这一点，我需要存储信息。

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.860
somewhere inside of my Scratch project.
在我的Scratch项目里的某个地方。

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:15.710
Sounds like we need a variable, some variable that's
听起来我们需要一个变量，某个能

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:18.570
going to keep track of this information for us.
为我们记录这些信息的变量。

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:19.760
So let's go to Variable.
所以让我们转到“变量”。

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.230
Let's make a new variable.
让我们创建一个新变量。

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.080
And I will call this variable catches.
我把这个变量叫做“抓到次数”。

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.580
That's going to represent the score.
它将代表得分。

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:30.710
It's how many catches the cat has made, how many crystals the cat has caught.
就是猫抓到了多少次，猫抓到了多少颗水晶。

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:33.410
You'll notice the catches right now is 0.
你会注意到现在“抓到次数”是0。

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:38.330
And I would like to make sure that when the game first begins that we always
我想确保在游戏刚开始时，我们总是

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.480
reset the number of catches back to 0.
把抓到次数重置为0。

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.298
So inside the cat, you'll notice that when the flag is clicked
所以在猫这个角色里，你会注意到当点击绿旗时

00:20:44.298 --> 00:20:45.590
we're doing a lot of resetting.
我们做了很多重置操作。

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:49.340
We're going to this original x equals 0 position to center
我们将猫移到初始的x等于0的位置

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:50.930
the cat at the beginning.
以便在游戏开始时让猫居中。

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:54.680
At the same time, let me set catches to 0 at the beginning.
同时，我要在一开始把捕获数设为 0。

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.310
Because if I accumulate a score and I play the game again,
因为如果我累计了分数，然后再次玩这个游戏，

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.690
I want to reset the score.
我想重置分数。

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:04.670
I want the score to go back to 0, and then I can start adding to the score.
我想让分数回到 0，然后我就可以开始加分了。

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.170
How do I add to the score?
我要怎么加分呢？

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.720
Well, that's going to happen in the crystal sprite
嗯，这会在水晶角色里实现。

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.550
when it's touching the cat.
当它碰到猫的时候。

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:14.120
If we're touching the cat, we have now caught one additional crystal.
如果我们碰到了猫，那就意味着又捕获了一颗水晶。

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.940
Let's change catches by one.
让我们把捕获数加 1。

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.290
And now what should happen?
现在应该怎么做呢？

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.740
Well, now once the cat has caught a crystal,
嗯，现在一旦猫捕获了一颗水晶，

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:26.510
let's create a new crystal for the cat to try to catch.
让我们为猫再创建一颗新的水晶让它去抓。

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:30.140
To do that, I can go back to control.
要做到这一点，我可以回到控制模块。

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.180
And I can create another clone.
我可以再创建一个克隆体。

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:36.140
Every time I create a clone, let's go ahead and stop this for now,
每次我创建一个克隆体，现在先暂停一下，

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:40.430
every time I create a new clone, that is going to create a new crystal.
每次我创建一个新的克隆体，就会产生一颗新的水晶。

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:42.680
And whenever we start as a clone, that crystal
每当我们以克隆体的形式开始时，那颗水晶

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:46.400
is going to go to the top of the screen and it's going to start to fall.
会跑到屏幕顶部然后开始下落。

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:51.950
And after I create a clone, let's go ahead and delete the current clone.
在我创建一个克隆体之后，让我们接着删除当前的克隆体。

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.070
So what's going on here?
那么这里发生了什么呢？

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:54.860
Why have I added these blocks into place?
为什么我要把这些积木块放在这里呢？

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:57.485
Well, when we're touching the cat, that's one additional catch.
嗯，当我们碰到猫的时候，就多捕获了一次。

00:21:57.485 --> 00:21:59.780
We're updating the variable, changing catches by one.
我们在更新变量，把捕获数加 1。

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:05.810
And creating a new clone, because once the cat has caught one crystal,
并且创建一个新的克隆体，因为一旦猫捕获了一颗水晶，

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:08.900
I'd like for a new crystal to appear at the top of the screen.
我希望有一颗新的水晶出现在屏幕顶部。

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:12.080
But then finally, I'm deleting this clone.
但最后，我要删除这个克隆体。

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:14.667
Once the cat has caught the crystal, I'm just
一旦猫捕获了水晶，我就只是

00:22:14.667 --> 00:22:17.250
going to delete that crystal, because I don't need it anymore.
要删除那颗水晶，因为我不再需要它了。

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:22.080
I have a new crystal that's going to be falling from the top of the screen
我有一颗新的水晶会从屏幕顶部落下来。

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:24.200
instead.
取而代之。

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:26.666
And so now let's try this program.
现在让我们来试试这个程序。

00:22:26.666 --> 00:22:28.790
I'll press the flag.
我会点击旗帜。

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:32.150
The cat gives some instructions, catches, resets back to 0,
猫给出一些指令，捕获数重置为 0，

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:34.490
and we see the crystal falling.
我们看到水晶在下落。

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:37.730
And when the cat catches it, notice the catches goes up by one.
当猫捕获到它时，注意捕获数会加 1。

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:40.095
The score has increased and a new crystal appears.
分数增加了，并且一颗新的水晶出现了。

00:22:40.095 --> 00:22:41.720
And you'll notice this keeps happening.
你会注意到这种情况会一直发生。

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:42.470
It's in a loop.
这是一个循环。

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:46.370
Every time a crystal is caught, our score goes up by one.
每次捕获一颗水晶，我们的分数就会加 1。

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:51.170
And the crystal creates a new crystal that appears at the top of the screen.
并且这颗水晶会创建一颗新的水晶出现在屏幕顶部。

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:56.060
And then the crystal that the cat caught disappears and we no longer see it.
然后猫咪抓到的水晶就会消失，我们就再也看不到它了。

00:22:56.060 --> 00:22:58.850
So we're just seeing this flow of crystals appear one at a time.
所以我们看到这些水晶是一个接一个地出现。

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:02.420
We're seeing our variable update and increase by one every time
我们能看到每次猫咪抓到水晶时，

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:03.800
the cat catches a crystal.
我们的变量就会更新并加一。

00:23:03.800 --> 00:23:07.020
And ultimately, this seems to now work pretty well.
最终，现在看来这个程序运行得还挺不错。

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:10.455
The problem that I see is that the game is a little bit too easy.
我发现的问题是，这个游戏有点太简单了。

00:23:10.455 --> 00:23:12.080
I'm not even at the computer right now.
我现在甚至都没在操作电脑。

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:15.020
I'm not moving the cat at all and the crystal is just
我根本没移动猫咪，而水晶就

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:17.390
appearing right on top of the cat and the cat
正好出现在猫咪头顶，然后猫咪

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:20.310
is catching it every single time.
每次都能抓到它。

00:23:20.310 --> 00:23:21.920
So that's maybe not quite what I want.
所以这可能不是我想要的效果。

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:25.290
What I'd like to do is introduce a bit of randomness into a game.
我想做的是给游戏增加一点随机性。

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:27.590
And this is a common property of games, randomness,
随机性是游戏的一个常见特性，

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:30.440
because you don't want the game to be exactly the same every time.
因为你不想每次玩游戏时情况都完全一样。

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.900
You want some different choices to be made sometimes,
你希望有时候能有不同的选择，

00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:35.210
a little bit of unpredictability so that the user
有那么一点不可预测性，这样玩家

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:37.880
is going to have to respond to whatever they see.
就得对看到的情况做出反应。

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:40.850
And in this case, the unpredictability that I want
在这个例子中，我想要的不可预测性

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:43.340
is the x value of the crystal.
就是水晶的 x 坐标。

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:45.950
That right now the x value of the crystal is always 0.
现在水晶的 x 坐标一直是 0。

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:49.190
It's always going to x equals 0.
它总是会移动到 x 等于 0 的位置。

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:51.050
And because of that, the crystal is always
正因为如此，水晶总是

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:53.210
just immediately on top of the cat.
直接出现在猫咪头顶。

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:57.020
What I'd like to happen is for the crystal to sometimes be on the left
我希望水晶有时候出现在左边，

00:23:57.020 --> 00:23:58.400
and sometimes be on the right.
有时候出现在右边。

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:00.920
That way I have to move around rather than just keep
这样我就得四处移动，而不是什么都不做

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:03.930
increasing my score by doing nothing.
就能不断增加分数。

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:05.610
So let's go ahead and do that.
那我们就来做这件事吧。

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:09.080
I will come over here and stop my project.
我到这里来，先停止我的项目。

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:12.290
And instead of going to x equals 0 every time
每次水晶出现时，不再总是移动到 x 等于 0 的位置，

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:15.200
the crystal starts, let's add some randomness.
我们来增加一些随机性。

00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:16.550
I go under Operators.
我点击“运算”分类。

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:18.290
Here's pick random.
这里有“随机选取一个数”。

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:21.150
And far left, that's going to be a big negative number.
最左边会是一个很大的负数。

00:24:21.150 --> 00:24:24.410
So we'll go from negative 200 to the far right.
所以我们让范围从负 200 到最右边。

00:24:24.410 --> 00:24:26.210
That's going to be a big positive number.
最右边会是一个很大的正数。

00:24:26.210 --> 00:24:27.710
I'll make it positive 200.
我把它设为正 200。

00:24:27.710 --> 00:24:30.960
But you could play around with those values for whatever you'd like.
但你可以根据自己的喜好调整这些数值。

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:36.020
And now when I start the game, the score resets and notice
现在我启动游戏，分数会重置，注意看

00:24:36.020 --> 00:24:38.810
that the crystal is going to appear.
水晶会出现了。

00:24:38.810 --> 00:24:42.140
This time it was kind of centered, but maybe it won't be that way every time.
这次它差不多在中间，但也许不会每次都这样。

00:24:42.140 --> 00:24:45.260
Now the crystal's off to the right, and I have to move to the right
现在水晶在右边，我得往右移动

00:24:45.260 --> 00:24:47.430
in order to catch it.
才能抓住它。

00:24:47.430 --> 00:24:49.670
And every time I catch the crystal, the crystal
而且每次我抓住水晶，水晶

00:24:49.670 --> 00:24:54.650
is going to generate a new random number between negative 200 and 200.
都会生成一个 -200 到 200 之间的随机数。

00:24:54.650 --> 00:24:58.140
And that's going to tell me where I need to go in order to catch the crystal.
这个随机数会告诉我要去哪里才能抓住水晶。

00:24:58.140 --> 00:25:02.030
This is a much more interesting game than when the crystal was just always
这比水晶每次都

00:25:02.030 --> 00:25:05.790
appearing in the same spot every time.
出现在同一个位置的游戏有趣多了。

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:08.270
So this is definitely an improvement.
所以这绝对是个改进。

00:25:08.270 --> 00:25:10.700
And now I'm curious, what happens if I miss?
现在我很好奇，如果我没抓住会怎样？

00:25:10.700 --> 00:25:14.900
If I miss the crystal altogether and just let the crystal fall.
如果我完全没抓住水晶，就让它掉下去。

00:25:14.900 --> 00:25:17.840
All right, the crystal hits the bottom of the screen
好吧，水晶碰到了屏幕底部

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:20.570
