有多少次没抓住。

00:26:09.300 --> 00:26:14.480
So I'm going to go to variables and create a new variable called misses.
所以我要去变量那里创建一个名为“没抓住次数”的新变量。

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:18.860
How many times has the cat now missed the crystal?
现在猫没抓住水晶多少次了？

00:26:18.860 --> 00:26:21.200
And just as in the beginning of the cat, we
就像游戏开始时，我们

00:26:21.200 --> 00:26:25.370
set catches to 0 to reset the value of catches at the beginning of the game,
把抓住次数设为 0 来重置这个值，

00:26:25.370 --> 00:26:28.430
let's also now set misses to 0.
现在我们也把没抓住次数设为 0。

00:26:28.430 --> 00:26:31.110
When the game first begins, you haven't missed any yet.
游戏刚开始时，你还一次都没没抓住过。

00:26:31.110 --> 00:26:32.810
So let's reset it back to 0.
所以我们把它重置回 0。

00:26:32.810 --> 00:26:37.940
That way any previous progress in the game is erased.
这样一来，游戏之前的所有进度就都清零了。

00:26:37.940 --> 00:26:41.600
But now if ever we're touching the edge, let's go ahead
但现在，要是角色碰到边缘了，咱们接着

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:46.280
and change the number of misses by one.
把未接住的次数加一。

00:26:46.280 --> 00:26:49.490
And at that point, we can do much the same thing as we were doing before.
在那之后，我们可以做和之前差不多的事。

00:26:49.490 --> 00:26:53.432
We're going to create a new crystal by creating a clone.
我们要通过创建克隆体来生成一颗新的水晶。

00:26:53.432 --> 00:26:55.640
Let's go ahead and stop this for now, otherwise we're
咱们现在先把这个停了，不然的话，我们

00:26:55.640 --> 00:26:57.230
going to get a lot of clones.
会得到大量的克隆体。

00:26:57.230 --> 00:27:02.925
But then let's also delete this clone after that.
然后，之后我们还要删除这个克隆体。

00:27:02.925 --> 00:27:06.050
So when we're touching the edge, we're going to change the number of misses
所以，当角色碰到边缘时，我们要把未接住的次数

00:27:06.050 --> 00:27:06.550
by one.
加一。

00:27:06.550 --> 00:27:07.970
We now have one additional miss.
现在我们又多了一次未接住。

00:27:07.970 --> 00:27:10.340
We're going to create a new crystal, and then we're
我们要生成一颗新的水晶，然后

00:27:10.340 --> 00:27:13.760
going to delete the clone to say we're done with this crystal.
删除这个克隆体，表明这颗水晶处理完了。

00:27:13.760 --> 00:27:15.750
We've now created a new one.
现在我们已经生成了一颗新的水晶。

00:27:15.750 --> 00:27:19.220
So now we'll see how the game behaves.
那么现在我们来看看游戏会有什么表现。

00:27:19.220 --> 00:27:20.450
The crystals are falling.
水晶正在下落。

00:27:20.450 --> 00:27:23.278
I can try to catch them.
我可以试着接住它们。

00:27:23.278 --> 00:27:24.320
That's one that I caught.
那颗我接住了。

00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:27.110
I'll catch one more.
我再去接一颗。

00:27:27.110 --> 00:27:31.175
Now let me miss this one and see what happens.
现在我故意接不住这颗，看看会怎样。

00:27:31.175 --> 00:27:34.050
The crystal is going to hit the bottom of the screen and I missed it.
水晶会碰到屏幕底部，我没接住。

00:27:34.050 --> 00:27:36.500
You notice my misses goes up by one.
你会注意到我未接住的次数增加了一次。

00:27:36.500 --> 00:27:39.590
If I miss this one as well, misses goes up again.
如果这颗我也没接住，未接住的次数会再次增加。

00:27:39.590 --> 00:27:42.440
And now I effectively have two variables,
现在我实际上有两个变量了，

00:27:42.440 --> 00:27:47.070
one keeping track of how many times I've caught the crystal and one keeping
一个用来记录我接住水晶的次数，另一个用来

00:27:47.070 --> 00:27:49.070
track of how many times I've missed the crystal.
记录我未接住水晶的次数。

00:27:49.070 --> 00:27:50.778
And there seems to be no limit right now.
目前看来似乎没有上限。

00:27:50.778 --> 00:27:54.050
Misses can just keep going up and up and up every time I miss the crystal.
每次我没接住水晶，未接住的次数就会一直往上增加。

00:27:54.050 --> 00:27:58.400
What I'd like to do is do something once I miss three of them.
我想做的是，一旦我有三次未接住，就采取一些措施。

00:27:58.400 --> 00:28:02.160
Once I miss three, I want the game to be over.
一旦有三次未接住，我希望游戏就结束。

00:28:02.160 --> 00:28:05.090
So let's add a condition to check for that.
所以咱们添加一个条件来检查这种情况。

00:28:05.090 --> 00:28:06.590
I'm going to take this if condition.
我要使用这个“如果”条件积木。

00:28:06.590 --> 00:28:09.110
I'll build it out here for now and then I'll drag it in,
我先在这里把它搭建出来，之后再拖进去，

00:28:09.110 --> 00:28:11.060
just to keep it separate for now.
目前先把它单独放着。

00:28:11.060 --> 00:28:15.590
But I'm going to say if the number of misses is equal to three,
但我要说，如果未接住的次数等于三，

00:28:15.590 --> 00:28:19.220
so equals is an operator, and I'm going to say if the number of misses
所以“等于”是一个运算符，我要说如果未接住的次数

00:28:19.220 --> 00:28:22.350
are now equal to three, well what should we do?
现在等于三了，那我们该怎么做呢？

00:28:22.350 --> 00:28:24.440
Well, the game is now going to be over.
嗯，游戏现在要结束了。

00:28:24.440 --> 00:28:28.670
So I'm going to eventually delete this clone, because I no longer need
所以最后我要删除这个克隆体，因为游戏结束后我不再需要

