这颗水晶了。

00:28:30.930 --> 00:28:34.250
But at this point as well, I need some way
但到这一步，我也需要某种方法

00:28:34.250 --> 00:28:37.550
to signal to the rest of the program that the game is over.
来向程序的其他部分发出游戏结束的信号。

00:28:37.550 --> 00:28:39.350
I need the cat to know the game is over.
我得让猫咪知道游戏结束了。

00:28:39.350 --> 00:28:42.590
Because maybe the cat is now going to report what my score was.
因为也许猫咪现在要汇报我的得分了。

00:28:42.590 --> 00:28:44.390
What is my score at the end of the game?
游戏结束时我的得分是多少？

00:28:44.390 --> 00:28:46.760
How many crystals did I catch?
我抓到了多少颗水晶？

00:28:46.760 --> 00:28:51.068
So how can the crystal tell the cat that something has happened in the project?
那么水晶要怎么告诉猫咪项目里发生了某些事呢？

00:28:51.068 --> 00:28:52.610
Well, that's going to be a broadcast.
嗯，这就要用到广播了。

00:28:52.610 --> 00:28:56.750
Broadcast as a way of sending messages, again, between sprites.
广播是一种在角色之间传递消息的方式。

00:28:56.750 --> 00:28:58.590
I'll broadcast a message.
我要广播一条消息。

00:28:58.590 --> 00:29:02.720
But instead of begin, the message is going to be game over.
但消息内容不是“开始”，而是“游戏结束”。

00:29:02.720 --> 00:29:03.800
The game is over.
游戏结束了。

00:29:03.800 --> 00:29:06.080
Let's make sure the cat knows that.
咱们得确保猫咪知道这一点。

00:29:06.080 --> 00:29:12.740
And let's drag that into this logic right after we change misses by one.
咱们把它拖到这里的逻辑里，就在我们把“未接住次数”加 1 之后。

00:29:12.740 --> 00:29:15.350
So we increase the number of misses, and then we check.
所以我们增加未接住的次数，然后进行检查。

00:29:15.350 --> 00:29:17.270
Is our number of misses equal to three?
我们未接住的次数是否等于 3 次？

00:29:17.270 --> 00:29:20.060
If so we broadcast that the game is over.
如果是，我们就广播游戏结束。

00:29:20.060 --> 00:29:27.050
And now last step here, in the cat I need to respond to that event.
现在最后一步，在猫咪角色这里我需要对这个事件做出响应。

00:29:27.050 --> 00:29:31.770
When I receive game over, what should happen?
当我收到“游戏结束”的消息时，应该发生什么呢？

00:29:31.770 --> 00:29:35.780
Well, when I receive game over, let's go ahead and say the score.
嗯，当我收到“游戏结束”的消息时，咱们就报出得分。

00:29:35.780 --> 00:29:39.500
Let's say-- and I could just say the score directly.
咱们就说——我可以直接说出得分。

00:29:39.500 --> 00:29:42.200
But to make it a little nicer, I'll join together two words.
但为了让它更好一点，我要把两个词连起来。

00:29:42.200 --> 00:29:47.810
I'll say your score is and then a space and then
我说“你的得分是”，然后空一格，接着

00:29:47.810 --> 00:29:50.900
I'll drag in the number of catches.
我把“接住次数”拖进来。

00:29:50.900 --> 00:29:53.030
And I'll say that for five seconds.
我会把这句话说 5 秒钟。

00:29:53.030 --> 00:29:55.790
So when the game is over, when I receive that message,
所以当游戏结束，当我收到那条消息时，

00:29:55.790 --> 00:29:59.420
the cat is going to say your score is this for five seconds
猫咪会在 5 秒钟内说出“你的得分是这个”

00:29:59.420 --> 00:30:01.933
and then the game will be over.
然后游戏就结束了。

00:30:01.933 --> 00:30:02.600
So let's try it.
那咱们试试看。

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:03.308
I start the game.
我开始游戏。

