And I'll miss a third one.
我还会漏接第三颗。

00:30:25.500 --> 00:30:27.375
I'll get out of the way just to test out what
我让开一下，就为了测试一下

00:30:27.375 --> 00:30:29.520
happens when I actually lose the game.
当我真的输掉游戏时就会发生这种情况。

00:30:29.520 --> 00:30:30.690
That's my third miss.
那是我第三次没接住了。

00:30:30.690 --> 00:30:35.700
We broadcast that the game is over, and the cat reports that my score is two.
我们广播游戏结束，然后猫咪显示我的得分是两分。

00:30:35.700 --> 00:30:38.250
So at this point, we now have a completed game that
所以到现在，我们有了一个完成的游戏，它

00:30:38.250 --> 00:30:40.020
does sort of what we wanted it to do.
基本能实现我们想要的功能。

00:30:40.020 --> 00:30:41.400
The cat can move around.
猫咪可以四处移动。

00:30:41.400 --> 00:30:43.230
Crystals are falling from the sky.
水晶从天上掉落。

00:30:43.230 --> 00:30:46.680
The cat's able to try and catch as many of those crystals as we can.
猫咪能够尽可能多地去尝试接住那些水晶。

00:30:46.680 --> 00:30:49.345
And you could now play this game, share it with others.
现在你可以玩这个游戏，还能和其他人分享。

00:30:49.345 --> 00:30:51.720
And the nice thing is that you can always add to the game
好的地方在于，你随时可以给游戏添加新内容。

00:30:51.720 --> 00:30:54.660
if you think of new things you'd like to try inside of the game
如果你想到了想在游戏里尝试的新点子。

00:30:54.660 --> 00:30:56.040
just to experiment with it.
只是为了做些实验。

00:30:56.040 --> 00:31:00.190
Maybe, for example, right now I think the game is maybe a little too easy.
比如，现在我觉得这个游戏可能有点太简单了。

00:31:00.190 --> 00:31:02.670
There's always just one crystal falling from the sky
天上总是只有一颗水晶掉落。

00:31:02.670 --> 00:31:04.570
