I'm going to put this in a forever loop, meaning we're always
我要把这个放到一个无限循环里，这意味着我们会一直

00:31:27.670 --> 00:31:29.260
going to be creating crystals.
创建水晶。

00:31:29.260 --> 00:31:33.340
Now, if I just did that to create lots and lots of crystals, what you'll see
现在，如果我只是这样做来创建大量的水晶，你会看到

00:31:33.340 --> 00:31:37.600
is something like this where suddenly hundreds of crystals
像这样的情况，突然成百颗水晶

00:31:37.600 --> 00:31:40.220
are falling from the sky all at the same time.
同时从天上掉落。

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:43.180
That's maybe a little bit too challenging.
这可能有点太有挑战性了。

00:31:43.180 --> 00:31:47.080
But let's add a wait here and say create a crystal
但是我们在这里加一个等待指令，然后说创建一颗水晶。

00:31:47.080 --> 00:31:49.900
and then wait 15 seconds or so.
然后等大概15秒。

00:31:49.900 --> 00:31:52.450
We're going to wait 15 seconds and then create
我们要等15秒，然后再创建

00:31:52.450 --> 00:31:56.110
a new crystal so that a new crystal appears every 15 seconds.
一颗新水晶，这样每15秒就会出现一颗新水晶。

