And now you'll notice there are two crystals that have to try and catch.
现在你会注意到有两颗水晶要去尝试接住了。

00:32:20.890 --> 00:32:21.515
I'll catch one.
我来抓一个。

00:32:21.515 --> 00:32:22.740
Can I get the other one?
我能抓到另一个吗？

00:32:22.740 --> 00:32:25.400
All right, I caught the other one.
好啦，我抓到另一个了。

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:29.110
And in another 15 seconds, we're going to see the game get even harder.
再过15秒，我们会看到游戏变得更难。

00:32:32.470 --> 00:32:34.540
Now if you notice, there are three crystals that
现在如果你注意看，有三颗水晶

00:32:34.540 --> 00:32:36.667
are all out there at the same time.
同时都在那里。

00:32:36.667 --> 00:32:38.750
And maybe I'm going to start to miss some of them.
也许我会开始漏抓一些了。

00:32:38.750 --> 00:32:42.130
I missed one already, and I'm probably going to miss a couple more now.
我已经漏抓了一个，现在可能还会再漏抓几个。

00:32:42.130 --> 00:32:48.190
And now I missed three, and it's telling me that my score is 14.
现在我漏抓了三个，它显示我的得分是14分。

00:32:48.190 --> 00:32:50.390
And the crystals are still falling.
而水晶还在往下掉。

00:32:50.390 --> 00:32:53.560
And so what could I do to stop everything after the game is over?
那么游戏结束后，我要怎么做才能让一切停下来呢？

00:32:53.560 --> 00:32:56.770
Well, after the game is over, after I say your score is something,
嗯，游戏结束后，在我显示你的得分之后，

00:32:56.770 --> 00:33:01.300
I can go onto this block, stop all, and that's just going to stop everything.
我可以使用这个积木，全部停止，这样就能让一切停下来。

00:33:01.300 --> 00:33:03.550
Every sprite is just going to stop operating
所有角色都会停止运作

00:33:03.550 --> 00:33:07.630
after I say stop all so that the sprites don't continue to try to behave.
在我说全部停止之后，这样角色就不会继续行动了。

00:33:07.630 --> 00:33:09.850
Since I have multiple clones of the crystals,
因为我有多个水晶克隆体，

00:33:09.850 --> 00:33:13.400
stop all will just now stop all of them.
全部停止现在就能让它们都停下来。

00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:15.852
So hopefully you can start to see now that by combining
希望你现在能开始明白，通过组合

00:33:15.852 --> 00:33:18.310
these various different pieces, these different components,
这些不同的部分，这些不同的组件，

00:33:18.310 --> 00:33:21.430
these different tools and programming from different parts of Scratch,
这些不同的工具，以及Scratch不同部分的编程方法，

00:33:21.430 --> 00:33:25.910
we can start to create some creative and exciting projects as well.
我们也能开始创作出一些有创意又有趣的项目。

00:33:25.910 --> 00:33:27.760
So now as we wrap up this course, you now
那么现在，在我们结束这门课程时，你现在

00:33:27.760 --> 00:33:30.280
have the tools you need to build projects of your own
已经拥有了自己构建项目所需的工具

00:33:30.280 --> 00:33:33.820
that are interesting to you by taking advantage of functions and loops
利用函数、循环

00:33:33.820 --> 00:33:36.490
and conditions and values and variables and events
条件、数值、变量和事件

00:33:36.490 --> 00:33:39.848
and more to create interesting and exciting programs of your own.
以及更多元素，来创作出属于你自己的有趣又刺激的程序。

00:33:39.848 --> 00:33:41.140
And I'd encourage you to do so.
我鼓励你这么做。

00:33:41.140 --> 00:33:43.120
Play around with this Scratch interface.
多玩玩这个Scratch界面。

00:33:43.120 --> 00:33:47.095
Try and create a story or an animation or a game that's exciting to you.
试着创作一个让你觉得兴奋的故事、动画或游戏。

00:33:47.095 --> 00:33:48.220
Share it with your friends.
和你的朋友分享它。

00:33:48.220 --> 00:33:49.303
Share it with your family.
和你的家人分享它。

00:33:49.303 --> 00:33:51.100
And we look forward to what you create.
我们期待着你创作出的东西。

00:33:51.100 --> 00:33:52.580
Thank you so much for joining us.
非常感谢你参与我们的课程。

00:33:52.580 --> 00:33:56.310
This was an introduction to Programming with Scratch.
这是用Scratch学编程的入门课程。
